# `develop` — a `fieldPath: customFields.${code}` field was inserted between
# `code` and `title` (commit 53811230d, pre-FE-3240; mappers.ts is untouched by
# FE-3240 itself), shifting the context the old hunk searched for. Same
# mutation, new context.
#
# Mutates: client-personal-details.mappers.ts — both custom-field mapping sites
# swap `mapCustomFieldValue(...)` for `String(...)`, bypassing the seam.
#
# Expected RED: client-personal-details.mappers.test.ts —
# "AC-59 projects a custom field's value exactly as A's own seam
# (mapCustomFieldValues) coerces it — never re-derived locally" — the value must
# ride A's coercion seam, never a local String(). Collateral:
# definition-driven-read.int.test.ts AC-63 also reddens (an absent value renders
# the literal "undefined" instead of the type's oracle empty value).
#
# Apply / verify / revert:
#   git apply <this file>
#   pnpm --filter @upmind-automation/headless test client-personal-details.mappers   # must go RED
#   git apply -R <this file>
#
